        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_zuop-OibEd9gmZE1kWI-71" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Some design decisions and their rationale:&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Separating out profile and swipe service and their DBs:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Swipe service handles much higher write throughput compared to profile service and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;thus the separation to have separation of concerns, scale the services/DB independently.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Why use of ElasticSearch for Feed Service? And why usage of CDC?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="177" width="461" x="-325" y="3771" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_zuop-OibEd9gmZE1kWI-72" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="ElasticSearch helps solve two different usecases in one go:&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Filtering potential matches based upon filters like age preference, gender preference etc. Doing a full table scan on a DB like Cassandra would be immensely slow.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. ElasticSearch supports geospatial queries as well, for the usecase where we want to fetch all matches in x radius of user&#39;s location, they can do it with ElasticSearch geospatial query&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. CDC is required to ensure data consistency between DynamoDB and ElasticSearch.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="229" width="448" x="-341" y="3976" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_zuop-OibEd9gmZE1kWI-73" edge="1" parent="1" source="_zuop-OibEd9gmZE1kWI-45" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;exitX=0;exitY=0.75;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="_zuop-OibEd9gmZE1kWI-41" value="">
